Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.11,0:00:54.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}少来了，和你交往的男人…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Come on. You're going out with a guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.45,0:00:56.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}多多少少一定有点问题！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}There's gotta be something wrong with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.20,0:00:59.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}他既驼背又戴假发？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So does he have a hump and a hair piece?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.54,0:01:02.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}等一下，他是不是会吃粉笔？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Wait. Does he eat chalk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.17,0:01:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我只是不希望你 重蹈我和卡尔的覆辙{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I don't want her to go through what I went through with Carl. Oh.{\r}
