Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.59,0:01:10.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}各位放轻松，这不算约会{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay, everybody relax. This is not even a date.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.59,0:01:13.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不过是两个人一起出去吃晚餐 而且不上床{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It's just two people going out to dinner and not having sex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.76,0:01:15.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对我来说这就是约会{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Sounds like a date to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.76,0:01:17.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs22\bord1\shad1\fsp1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（编剧：玛莎·卡夫曼　大卫·肯蓝）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.18,0:01:21.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}做了个梦，在中学时代 我站在餐厅中央…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm back in high school, in the middle of the cafeteria...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.23,0:01:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}突然发现自己全身赤裸{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and I realize I'm totally naked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.77,0:01:26.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 对，没错 - 我做过那样的梦{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Oh, yeah. - I've had that dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.52,0:01:30.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我低头一看，看见有一个电话…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Then I look down and I realize there is a phone...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.20,0:01:33.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}在那里{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.07,0:01:35.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 而不是… - 没错{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Instead of... - That's right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.20,0:01:37.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 我没做过那样的梦 - 没有{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}MONICA: That one, I've never had. PHOEBE: No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.87,0:01:42.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}突然，那个电话响了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}All of a sudden, the phone starts to ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.21,0:01:43.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}结果是我妈妈打来的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And it turns out it's my mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.71,0:01:50.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这非常奇怪 因为她从来都不会打电话给我！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Which is very, very weird because she never calls me.{\r}
