Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.01,0:01:56.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嗨{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.93,0:02:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这家伙说〝嗨〞的时候 我却想杀了我自己{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}This guy says "hello," I wanna kill myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.39,0:02:02.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你还好吧，亲爱的？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Are you okay, sweetie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.81,0:02:07.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我就感觉好像某人伸手进我的喉咙 抓住我的小肠，从我的嘴里拉出来{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I feel like someone grabbed my small intestine, pulled it out of my mouth...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.65,0:02:10.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 再在我的脖子上打结… - 要吃饼干吗？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and tied it around my neck. - Cookie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.53,0:02:14.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}卡萝今天搬走了她的东西{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Carol moved her stuff out today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.24,0:02:15.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}哦{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}PHOEBE & JOEY: Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.45,0:02:17.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 我给你拿杯咖啡 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Let me get you some coffee. - Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.20,0:02:21.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}呃{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ew. Unh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.12,0:02:26.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不，不要！ 不要清理我的光环！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No. No, don't! Stop cleansing my aura.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.38,0:02:28.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不要管我的光环，好吗？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Just leave my aura alone, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.92,0:02:33.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我会没事的，好吗？真的 我希望她开心{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'll be fine. All right? Really. I hope she'll be very happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.97,0:02:35.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 不，你并不希望 - 是的，我不希望！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- No, you don't. - No, I don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.47,0:02:37.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}叫她去死，是她离开了我！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}To hell with her. She left me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.35,0:02:40.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你从来都不知道她是女同性恋{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And you never knew she was a lesbian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.35,0:02:46.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不知道！行了吧！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No! Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.69,0:02:49.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}为什么每个人老是要提出来？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Why does everyone keep fixating on that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.11,0:02:53.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她都不知道，我又怎么会知道？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}She didn't know. How should I know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.74,0:02:58.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}有时候我希望我是女同性恋…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Sometimes I wish I was a lesbian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.03,0:03:02.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我讲得很大声吗？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Did I say that out loud?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.95,0:03:08.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}没事的，罗斯 你现在感到很痛苦{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}All right, Ross. Look, you're feeling a lot of pain right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.21,0:03:10.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你很生气，很伤心{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You're angry. You're hurting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.88,0:03:13.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我能告诉你解决方法是什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Can I tell you what the answer is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.30,0:03:14.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}脱衣舞厅！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Strip joints!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.76,0:03:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}别这样，你单身了！有需求的！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Come on, you're single. Have some hormones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.30,0:03:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我不想单身，好吗？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}See, but I don't want to be single, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.81,0:03:24.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我只想…再次结婚！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I just wanna be married again.{\r}
