Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.49,0:03:40.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我刚到你那里去，而你不在 那个拿着大锤子的家伙说{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I went to your building and this guy with a hammer said...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.82,0:03:43.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你可能在这里 你真在这里！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...that you might be here, and you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.29,0:03:46.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 你想喝点咖啡吗？ - 无咖啡因的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Can I get you some coffee? - Decaf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.37,0:03:51.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好了，各位，这位是瑞秋 另一个林肯高中的幸存者{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay, everybody, this is Rachel, another Lincoln High survivor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.59,0:03:54.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这就是各位 这是钱德、菲比{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}This is everybody. This is Chandler and Phoebe...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.25,0:03:56.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}乔伊，还有 你还记得我哥哥罗斯吗？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and Joey. And remember my brother, Ross?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.67,0:03:57.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 当然，嘿！ - 嘿{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Sure! - Hey.{\r}
