Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.68,0:04:11.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那你现在可以告诉我们了吗 还是说我们在等着四位湿漉的伴娘?{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So you wanna tell us now, or are we waiting for four wet bridesmaids?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.52,0:04:18.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吧，大概在婚礼前半个小时{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, God! Well, it started about a half-hour before the wedding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.65,0:04:21.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我在礼物间里{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I was in this room with all the presents...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.24,0:04:23.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}看着那个肉汁壶{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and I was looking at this gravy boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.28,0:04:26.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那是个非常好看的肉汁壶{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}This really gorgeous Limoges gravy boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.87,0:04:28.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}然后，突然…　有代糖吗？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}When all of a sudden... Sweet 'N Low?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.87,0:04:31.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我发现…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- I realized...{\r}
