Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.25,0:04:38.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}然后我吓呆了 然后这个想法突然出现在脑中：{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Then I got really freaked out, and that's when it hit me:{\r}
