Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.68,0:04:44.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我总是觉得他眼熟，但是…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You know, I mean, I always knew he looked familiar, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.10,0:04:50.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}总之 我必须离开那里，我在想：{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Anyway, I just had to get out of there, and I started wondering:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.69,0:04:54.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}〝我为什么这样做，我为谁这样做？〞{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}"Why am I doing this?" And "Who am I doing this for?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.44,0:04:58.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我不知道该去哪里 而且我知道我和你有点疏远了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Anyway, I just didn't know where to go, and I know you and I have drifted apart...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.03,0:05:01.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}但你是我这个城市里唯一认识的人{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...but you're the only person I know in the city.{\r}
