Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.22,0:05:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我猜他给她买了个管风琴{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm guessing he bought her the big pipe organ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.89,0:05:26.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}而她很不喜欢那个{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and she's really not happy about it.{\r}
