Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.98,0:05:38.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这对我很有关系！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, it matters to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.15,0:05:43.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她真不应该穿那条裤子{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}CHANDLER: She should not be wearing those pants.{\r}
