Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.30,0:06:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}〝你是鞋子…〞{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You're a shoe! You're a shoe! You're a shoe!"{\r}
