Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.31,0:06:12.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}或一顶帽子？〞{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Or a hat?"{\r}
