Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.73,0:06:17.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这是个比喻，爸爸！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It's a metaphor, Daddy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.69,0:06:21.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你看得出他哪里听不懂{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You can see where he'd have trouble.{\r}
