Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.66,0:07:12.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我现在好多了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm all better now.{\r}
